<title>USA: Mellon names John Chesko vice chairman.</title>
<headline>Mellon names John Chesko vice chairman.</headline>
<dateline>PITTSBURGH 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mellon Bank Corp said Tuesday its board named John Chesko vice chairman and chief risk officer.</p>
<p>Chesko succeeds Keith Russell, who earlier was named chairman of Mellon Financial Group-West Coast, the banking company said in a statement.</p>
<p>The company said Chesko will oversee areas that include credit approval, underwriting and monitoring. He had previously served as manager of Mellon's credit policy and procedures division.</p>
